WEBVTT

00:06.047 --> 00:08.299
THIS EPISODE CONTAINS
GRAPHIC DEPICTIONS OF SCHOOL VIOLENCE

00:08.383 --> 00:09.884
WHICH SOME VIEWERS MAY FIND DISTURBING.

00:20.895 --> 00:21.980
Is it this person?

00:22.522 --> 00:24.566
Could you check
the other addresses as well?

00:24.649 --> 00:25.859
Sure, read them to me.

00:27.068 --> 00:28.903
13-1 Seojung-ro.

00:28.987 --> 00:30.739
319-2 Changdong-ro.

00:31.322 --> 00:32.949
417-1 Sanggok-ro.

00:33.700 --> 00:35.201
27 Daewon 3-ro.

00:35.285 --> 00:36.286
21 Mijeong-ro.

00:38.121 --> 00:39.039
Wait.

00:39.122 --> 00:42.167
This person was at all the addresses
you read out.

00:47.672 --> 00:51.843
Yes, Officer Lee. I just checked.
This guy was at every address you gave me.

00:52.677 --> 00:54.179
Okay, got it. Thanks.

01:19.037 --> 01:22.248
Come on, at least try to look happy
to see me again.

01:54.781 --> 01:55.698
Is everyone okay?

01:56.533 --> 01:57.659
Kids, are you okay?

01:58.368 --> 02:00.370
- Anyone hurt?
- No.

02:01.037 --> 02:03.039
Everyone seems okay.

02:03.790 --> 02:06.459
That's a relief.
Please head outside with the kids.

02:06.543 --> 02:07.377
Okay.

02:34.320 --> 02:36.865
Hey, wait.

02:37.657 --> 02:39.742
Gyu-jin, I'm sorry.

02:43.705 --> 02:45.748
I'm sorry.

02:47.667 --> 02:49.919
I'm sorry, Gyu-jin.

02:53.798 --> 02:54.841
Wait.

03:06.477 --> 03:08.229
I can't possibly know…

03:11.191 --> 03:12.817
all that you've been through.

03:16.196 --> 03:17.864
But what you're about to do…

03:22.076 --> 03:23.870
will only end up hurting you.

03:25.538 --> 03:27.207
Don't act like you understand.

03:31.169 --> 03:32.212
It's too late.

03:33.254 --> 03:34.464
It's not too late.

03:38.927 --> 03:40.845
If you open up to me

03:42.513 --> 03:43.765
about your struggles…

03:47.936 --> 03:49.729
I might be able to help.

03:59.614 --> 04:01.532
I just want to hear your story.

04:05.328 --> 04:06.329
I mean it.

04:13.962 --> 04:14.963
But to do that,

04:16.673 --> 04:18.383
you need to put the gun down

04:19.676 --> 04:21.094
so we can talk.

04:25.723 --> 04:27.058
You will, won't you?

05:02.135 --> 05:03.136
That asshole…

05:07.598 --> 05:10.018
He's a total piece of shit.

05:11.936 --> 05:12.937
Good job.

05:14.480 --> 05:16.399
You did well to hold back, Gyu-jin.

05:26.159 --> 05:27.702
Great job. You did well.

05:30.204 --> 05:31.205
You did well.

05:48.431 --> 05:50.725
- My son is in there!
- Is he even human?

05:50.808 --> 05:52.643
We'll explain everything later.

05:55.772 --> 05:57.982
Seong-jun!

05:59.776 --> 06:01.486
- What happened?
- Seong-jun!

06:01.569 --> 06:02.445
Wake up, Seong-jun!

06:02.528 --> 06:04.530
- It's Mom. Look at me.
- It's Dad.

06:04.614 --> 06:06.866
What on earth happened?

06:07.617 --> 06:09.494
- Let go of me!
- Get off me!

06:09.577 --> 06:12.038
Seong-jun, wake up!
Don't you recognize us?

06:12.121 --> 06:13.581
Don't touch me!

06:14.749 --> 06:16.125
Seong-jun, it's Dad.

06:18.127 --> 06:20.129
Ma'am, please don't push. It's not safe.

06:27.261 --> 06:29.013
Gyu-jin!

06:29.097 --> 06:29.931
Excuse me.

06:30.014 --> 06:34.143
No, I'm his mom. I said I'm his mom!

06:34.227 --> 06:35.186
Gyu-jin!

06:35.269 --> 06:36.813
Let go of me!

06:36.896 --> 06:38.689
- You can't go any further.
- I'm his mom!

06:38.773 --> 06:41.317
Gyu-jin, what are you doing there?

06:41.401 --> 06:44.654
You didn't do anything wrong. Tell them.

06:44.737 --> 06:47.532
Tell them now, Gyu-jin.

06:47.615 --> 06:50.701
No, Gyu-jin! My goodness!

06:50.785 --> 06:53.121
Gyu-jin, why are you
getting in the police car?

06:54.163 --> 06:58.042
Gyu-jin! No!

06:59.001 --> 07:00.253
Gyu-jin!

07:05.591 --> 07:06.426
Detective Seo.

07:07.301 --> 07:08.136
Yeah, go ahead.

07:09.178 --> 07:12.849
Arrest operation ready and all personnel
in position. Shall we get him?

07:12.932 --> 07:14.892
Hold your positions and stand by.

07:36.664 --> 07:37.540
Don't worry.

07:37.623 --> 07:39.542
I'll take you right to Jeon Won-seong.

07:40.168 --> 07:41.002
Don't move.

07:45.756 --> 07:46.674
I caught him.

07:46.757 --> 07:49.802
All it had was a piece of paper
and a bunch of bullets.

07:50.761 --> 07:52.138
Where's that address list now?

07:54.015 --> 07:55.141
I threw it out.

07:56.350 --> 07:58.686
The people who received those guns.

07:59.353 --> 08:03.357
To them, a gun could actually represent
both justice and power.

08:03.941 --> 08:05.985
There's a high school student on the list.

08:07.236 --> 08:08.696
Shouldn't you check?

08:08.779 --> 08:10.615
Kids turn in their phones before class.

08:13.868 --> 08:16.496
GYEONGIN SEOBU POLICE STATION
DETECTIVE SEO

08:16.579 --> 08:19.332
ONCE THE SITUATION IS OVER,
ARREST MOON BAEK

08:20.583 --> 08:23.377
Do, they're all ready.
Should we get him now?

08:26.547 --> 08:28.007
We're all moving in to get him.

08:28.090 --> 08:29.091
Copy that.

08:30.009 --> 08:31.302
Team two, move!

08:41.354 --> 08:42.188
What the hell?

08:42.271 --> 08:43.231
Where did he go?

08:44.732 --> 08:46.192
Where did that bastard go?

08:47.610 --> 08:49.529
- None of you saw him?
- No, sir.

08:49.612 --> 08:52.615
- Block the main gate and side exits.
- Yes, sir.

08:52.698 --> 08:54.575
- Hey, secure all exits.
- Yes, sir.

08:54.659 --> 08:55.952
You three. Come here!

08:59.288 --> 09:00.122
Officer Lee.

09:01.249 --> 09:04.210
I just received background information
on Moon Baek from Dongwol Industries,

09:04.293 --> 09:06.629
but he's not the guy we met.

09:15.096 --> 09:16.472
DONGJIN APARTMENT

09:58.764 --> 09:59.765
LEE DO

10:41.432 --> 10:45.853
South Korea can no longer be called
a gun-free country.

10:45.936 --> 10:49.023
As horrific shootings continue,
citizens are becoming increasingly…

10:49.106 --> 10:50.399
Tragic news.

10:50.483 --> 10:53.653
A mass shooting has occurred
at a high school

10:53.736 --> 10:56.280
after recent events at a gosiwon
and a police station…

10:56.364 --> 10:59.950
A Gyeonggi convenience store was robbed
at gunpoint early this morning.

11:00.868 --> 11:03.162
It took place around 2:00 a.m.
at a convenience store…

11:03.245 --> 11:06.499
As debates continue
over the source of guns in circulation

11:06.582 --> 11:07.833
and the forces behind them…

11:07.917 --> 11:11.712
After a series of gun incidents,
citizens demand that the government…

11:11.796 --> 11:13.005
Where are these guns from?

11:13.089 --> 11:15.716
- And the gun source?
- Is a criminal organization linked?

11:15.800 --> 11:17.593
- What are your plans to…
- Commissioner.

11:17.677 --> 11:19.470
How many more shootings do you foresee?

11:19.553 --> 11:20.388
More guns, right?

11:21.263 --> 11:23.224
The people are shaking in fear.

11:23.307 --> 11:25.518
Are there more guns out there or not?

11:26.727 --> 11:28.562
Or do you not know that either?

11:28.646 --> 11:30.940
Please avoid speculation and conjecture.

11:31.023 --> 11:33.693
Trust the police and be patient.

11:39.115 --> 11:40.157
Here he comes.

11:40.991 --> 11:42.118
- Sir!
- Hello.

11:45.204 --> 11:47.373
The police called me today.

11:47.456 --> 11:50.501
We're not exactly the law-abiding type,

11:51.085 --> 11:54.255
but if you want to make a living
in South Korea,

11:54.338 --> 11:57.299
there's one thing
you should never mess with.

11:58.092 --> 11:59.552
And that's guns.

11:59.635 --> 12:01.178
Didn't it turn out for the best?

12:01.846 --> 12:03.764
I mean, this is a global age now.

12:04.265 --> 12:07.768
How long are you going to stick
to just sashimi knives?

12:07.852 --> 12:11.605
Assault, fraud, drugs, and even murder
can all be settled in court,

12:13.149 --> 12:14.233
but not guns.

12:15.526 --> 12:16.819
The military gets involved.

12:16.902 --> 12:17.945
Exactly.

12:18.946 --> 12:22.032
The moment we get guns,
we'll be put down like dogs.

12:25.453 --> 12:29.999
Fuck, if this goes south,
I might take the fall for everything.

12:30.499 --> 12:33.169
What do we do
about the guns in the storage room?

12:49.143 --> 12:49.977
Hey.

12:52.062 --> 12:54.190
Give "Police in Name Only" a call.

12:54.273 --> 12:55.357
Yes, sir.

12:55.441 --> 12:57.568
Are you kidding me?

12:57.651 --> 12:59.904
How could you lose just one guy?

12:59.987 --> 13:01.405
Have you all gone blind?

13:02.031 --> 13:05.201
Do whatever it takes to find that bastard
and bring him to me.

13:05.284 --> 13:07.995
Retrieve every gun sent
to the addresses on the list.

13:08.078 --> 13:11.707
One more shooting,
and we're all handing in our badges.

13:11.791 --> 13:13.584
You got it?

13:14.835 --> 13:15.836
Yes, sir.

13:22.510 --> 13:23.344
Lee Do.

13:23.427 --> 13:24.929
You're back on duty today.

13:25.429 --> 13:27.807
I'll take full responsibility,
so join the team.

13:31.393 --> 13:33.187
GONG SEOK-HO

13:42.446 --> 13:43.531
Fucking hell.

13:44.031 --> 13:45.282
Quite keen, isn't he?

13:56.794 --> 13:57.628
Here.

14:00.381 --> 14:01.340
This is a real gun.

14:02.132 --> 14:03.884
Stay back, or I'll shoot.

14:03.968 --> 14:04.844
For real.

14:07.429 --> 14:09.849
Shit, don't fucking shoot me!

14:15.980 --> 14:17.606
Where did you get this gun?

14:20.609 --> 14:21.819
Man…

14:22.319 --> 14:26.699
Mr. Kim, a meth dealer,
offered me a club for cheap, so I took it.

14:26.782 --> 14:29.451
I found these
in the basement storage room.

14:30.327 --> 14:32.121
And where is this Mr. Kim now?

14:33.455 --> 14:35.708
No clue. How would I know?

14:35.791 --> 14:36.917
When I found these,

14:37.001 --> 14:40.170
I thought he was screwing me over,
so I was going to take him down.

14:40.254 --> 14:42.256
But I have no fucking clue where he is.

14:44.133 --> 14:44.967
Wait.

14:45.050 --> 14:46.760
Do you expect me to believe that?

14:46.844 --> 14:48.429
Okay, just wait. Here.

14:48.512 --> 14:49.597
Hey, check this out.

14:49.680 --> 14:51.390
Here, look.

14:55.352 --> 14:57.187
For fuck's sake.

14:57.897 --> 14:59.398
There's a guy named Gu Jeong-man.

15:00.107 --> 15:02.318
He works under me,
handling the grunt work.

15:03.027 --> 15:06.655
Officer Lee, it turns out
the guy you're looking for works for him.

15:07.907 --> 15:09.950
Man, I have no idea how he knew,

15:10.868 --> 15:14.204
but he was lingering outside
the club's storage room with the guns.

15:15.372 --> 15:16.415
What does that mean?

15:16.498 --> 15:19.043
Those bastards are looking for guns.

15:19.126 --> 15:20.711
You get what I'm saying?

15:26.300 --> 15:29.094
Why are you showing me all your cards?

15:29.178 --> 15:32.848
Because there were guns
at one of my businesses!

15:34.183 --> 15:37.436
You expect me to just sit back
when I'm about to get shot?

15:39.229 --> 15:41.148
I'll cooperate with you on everything,

15:41.231 --> 15:45.778
so leave me out
of this fucked-up mess, Officer Lee.

15:46.362 --> 15:48.656
I have nothing to do with these guns.

15:49.323 --> 15:51.659
I'm just an innocent citizen.

15:52.701 --> 15:53.535
Okay?

15:56.246 --> 15:59.416
Come on. You took them all
when you came last time.

15:59.500 --> 16:01.377
We did? Were they the police?

16:02.503 --> 16:06.048
I handed everything over after seeing
the police ID. Why are you back?

16:07.007 --> 16:08.050
- Hey.
- Yes?

16:08.550 --> 16:10.803
Was anyone else
meant to come here besides us?

16:10.886 --> 16:13.347
No, we're in charge of this area.

16:13.430 --> 16:15.391
Whatever. You guys figure it out.

16:17.267 --> 16:18.811
We've never been here.

16:19.478 --> 16:20.646
- I gave it to you.
- But…

16:20.729 --> 16:21.730
But I already did!

16:21.814 --> 16:23.983
Damn it, this is driving me crazy.

16:24.066 --> 16:27.194
You guys already took it.
Why are you asking again?

16:27.277 --> 16:30.239
This is serious. So if you're lying,
you'll be in big trouble.

16:30.322 --> 16:31.156
Give us the gun.

16:31.240 --> 16:32.866
God, you people are unbelievable.

16:32.950 --> 16:33.867
That's enough. Go.

16:33.951 --> 16:35.786
Sir, you never gave it to us.

16:35.869 --> 16:37.538
Wait a minute, sir!

16:42.751 --> 16:43.961
How many guns did you get?

16:44.545 --> 16:47.339
We've collected guns
from half the listed addresses.

16:47.423 --> 16:48.257
Only half?

16:48.340 --> 16:51.885
What are you going to do
if a madman starts shooting tomorrow?

16:51.969 --> 16:53.137
I'm sorry.

16:53.220 --> 16:56.098
I'll put all my men
on finding them as quickly as possible.

16:56.181 --> 16:59.351
What about those bastards
posing as cops to get the guns?

16:59.435 --> 17:00.978
We're also doing our best--

17:02.730 --> 17:05.607
The Joint Investigation HQ
will handle the case from here.

17:06.358 --> 17:08.861
Transfer the case files
and stay out of it.

17:08.944 --> 17:09.903
Sir.

17:16.160 --> 17:18.495
JOINT INVESTIGATION HQ

17:21.832 --> 17:24.918
The Ministry of Health and Welfare
designated regional hub hospitals

17:25.002 --> 17:28.088
and issued a manual
on treating shooting victims.

17:28.172 --> 17:30.049
With this, the medical community…

17:30.758 --> 17:34.094
I get indigestion from flour-based foods,
yet she brought bread again.

17:34.178 --> 17:35.220
Thanks.

17:35.304 --> 17:37.973
God, how oblivious and thickheaded
can she be?

17:39.224 --> 17:43.228
If you're from a no-name college,
at least be good at something.

17:43.312 --> 17:44.188
Right?

17:44.271 --> 17:45.230
I know, right?

17:45.731 --> 17:48.233
When will she finally get it right?

17:48.317 --> 17:50.527
Does she want to show off
her no-name school?

17:52.071 --> 17:55.199
Ma'am, I'll order some mango bingsu later.
It's your favorite.

17:55.282 --> 17:56.283
You're the best.

17:59.620 --> 18:02.790
By the way,
I'm starting personal training next week.

18:02.873 --> 18:05.125
Could you take me off night shifts?

18:05.209 --> 18:07.169
You barely had night shifts last month.

18:07.252 --> 18:09.213
Come on, ma'am. Please?

18:09.296 --> 18:10.214
Goodness me.

18:10.297 --> 18:13.425
All right. I'll adjust the schedule.

18:14.259 --> 18:16.095
We have someone for the night shift.

18:17.930 --> 18:19.848
Thank you so much, ma'am!

18:19.932 --> 18:22.684
I'll order that bingsu right away.

18:24.103 --> 18:26.814
I hear people
are frantically trying to buy

18:26.897 --> 18:29.942
replica firearms and gun parts
from overseas online retailers.

18:30.025 --> 18:34.363
We need to start an open discussion
on legalizing gun ownership.

18:34.446 --> 18:36.115
What are you talking about?

18:36.198 --> 18:38.450
An open discussion
on legalizing gun ownership

18:38.534 --> 18:41.120
in South Korea,
one of the world's safest countries?

18:41.203 --> 18:43.205
The problem is
it's being driven underground.

18:43.288 --> 18:45.916
We must legalize,
institutionalize, and systemize it so--

18:45.999 --> 18:48.293
It's not a problem
we can settle right now.

18:48.377 --> 18:51.380
As we face this unprecedented wave
of mass shootings,

18:51.463 --> 18:55.425
I urge any viewers
in possession of a firearm

18:55.509 --> 18:59.388
to report it to the nearest police station
as soon as possible.

19:04.059 --> 19:07.980
It seems Gong Seok-ho is cooperating
with the police investigation.

19:11.150 --> 19:13.610
The delivered guns are starting to move.

19:13.694 --> 19:15.946
We confirmed
the guns were used in Banhyeon-dong.

19:16.446 --> 19:18.407
What's Gu Jeong-man doing now?

19:18.991 --> 19:22.327
Looks like he's only recovered
half of the distributed guns so far.

19:23.287 --> 19:24.288
Only half?

19:26.957 --> 19:30.377
Man, shouldn't someone
be making a bang by now?

19:31.211 --> 19:33.922
We released those guns for people to use,

19:34.423 --> 19:37.718
whether to fight over them
or go up against the police.

19:39.136 --> 19:41.138
Come on. Do something, damn it.

19:49.646 --> 19:50.522
You like that?

19:50.606 --> 19:52.983
- This isn't a toy.
- This looks sleek.

19:53.483 --> 19:56.570
- I said this isn't a toy, dipshit.
- Go to the first floor and…

19:58.447 --> 20:01.283
- Didn't you serve in the army?
- He didn't even serve!

20:01.950 --> 20:03.202
This is top-notch!

20:03.952 --> 20:05.162
You fucking moron.

20:08.790 --> 20:09.958
Wait, this isn't it?

20:10.876 --> 20:12.002
Man, seriously.

20:12.085 --> 20:14.796
Don't make me repeat myself again.

20:14.880 --> 20:17.424
Do you have trust issues?

20:18.050 --> 20:22.262
I'm telling you,
we're the best launderers in town.

20:22.346 --> 20:23.430
You want goods?

20:23.931 --> 20:26.683
Don't you know goods equal cash?

20:26.767 --> 20:30.187
We launder it all, whether the money
is questionable, shady, or illegal.

20:30.270 --> 20:32.606
Stop worrying and send it over, okay?

20:37.945 --> 20:38.946
Good God.

20:40.822 --> 20:43.033
Sir, that's a cigar, isn't it?

20:43.116 --> 20:44.576
It was a gift.

20:45.827 --> 20:48.080
Cigars apparently symbolize
gentility and style.

20:49.122 --> 20:51.333
They're from Cuba. What do you think?

20:54.044 --> 20:56.088
- Does it suit me?
- Yes, you look so cool.

20:58.340 --> 21:00.759
Here. Take a drag, yeah?

21:08.684 --> 21:09.768
You lame ass.

21:09.851 --> 21:12.479
You're not supposed to inhale cigar smoke.
Give it back.

21:12.562 --> 21:13.563
Here it is.

21:16.483 --> 21:18.819
Jeong-man,
you need to clean up and look sharp.

21:19.569 --> 21:20.654
Speaking of which,

21:21.488 --> 21:24.783
I have a big job coming up,
so I need you to hustle one more time.

21:27.160 --> 21:28.787
A big job? What kind of…

21:34.209 --> 21:36.295
I plan to take over Mr. Kim's businesses.

21:36.378 --> 21:37.212
Sorry?

21:39.589 --> 21:40.465
You mean…

21:40.549 --> 21:43.385
Yes, Mr. Kim, the one you and I both know.

21:43.468 --> 21:44.720
We need to clean this up.

21:44.803 --> 21:48.932
Hey, Mr. Kim's selling something new
he brought from overseas,

21:49.016 --> 21:51.351
and it's apparently a huge cash cow.

21:51.435 --> 21:53.979
Mr. Kim's businesses?
This job seems too big.

21:54.062 --> 21:55.480
I got the order from above,

21:55.564 --> 21:57.899
so you and I
just need to take care of Mr. Kim.

21:58.567 --> 22:01.737
That's your expertise,
isn't it, Jeong-man?

22:02.946 --> 22:03.780
Sir.

22:04.781 --> 22:06.366
Once this job is over,

22:06.950 --> 22:11.747
could you please give me and my boys
a business to run?

22:14.750 --> 22:15.751
Come on.

22:16.668 --> 22:18.795
You're about to upset me again.

22:19.921 --> 22:22.883
If this goes well,
you're not just getting one business.

22:24.176 --> 22:25.677
You in or not?

22:26.636 --> 22:28.638
I'm in. I can do it.

22:28.722 --> 22:29.931
That's more like it!

22:30.432 --> 22:31.516
My Jeong-man!

22:32.434 --> 22:37.481
You're the only one I can trust.
Give them to me.

22:51.620 --> 22:55.123
Come on, man. Why are you hesitating?

22:55.207 --> 22:58.001
We've got guns. Let's wipe them all out.

22:59.544 --> 23:00.545
Did you know?

23:01.505 --> 23:04.424
A lion waits for the perfect moment,
even when hunting a rabbit.

23:05.384 --> 23:09.346
Not out of weakness
but to avoid making a mistake.

23:11.473 --> 23:13.058
When the time is right,

23:14.017 --> 23:15.769
we need to finish it all in one go.

23:17.062 --> 23:19.773
How many times do I have to tell you this?

23:19.856 --> 23:22.234
Gu Jeong-man is the one
who knows where Mr. Kim is.

23:22.818 --> 23:25.821
- Are you sure?
- Sure? Fucking hell, what…

23:30.575 --> 23:33.745
If you don't believe me,
go ask Gu Jeong-man yourself.

23:36.373 --> 23:37.707
Kim had all of these?

23:38.500 --> 23:39.334
Yes.

23:40.043 --> 23:44.339
Kim has been distributing
all the guns used in the shootings so far?

23:44.423 --> 23:46.925
- By disguising them as packages?
- Yes, that's correct.

23:48.510 --> 23:50.387
Where the hell is this bastard Kim?

23:50.470 --> 23:52.722
We're currently unable to locate him.

23:53.557 --> 23:56.726
If we use Gu Jeong-man and Gong
to find Kim,

23:57.394 --> 24:01.481
we can uncover the real masterminds
behind the distribution of these guns.

24:01.565 --> 24:04.359
All right. Come up with a plan

24:04.860 --> 24:07.279
and update the Joint Investigation HQ
on the progress.

24:07.904 --> 24:09.030
Yes, sir.

24:09.656 --> 24:10.657
Please approve this.

24:15.328 --> 24:16.288
Hey.

24:16.872 --> 24:18.790
I told you to stay out of this case.

24:18.874 --> 24:20.000
Sir.

24:20.083 --> 24:22.669
These guns are spreading as we speak.

24:22.752 --> 24:25.380
The sound of gunfire is echoing
throughout Seoul.

24:25.464 --> 24:27.340
We've had three incidents just today.

24:27.966 --> 24:29.885
We must find those guns immediately.

24:29.968 --> 24:31.845
Our job is to stop them.

24:39.728 --> 24:40.770
BACKGROUND CHECK

24:40.854 --> 24:43.356
Officer Lee identified him
as the gun distributor.

24:44.441 --> 24:47.736
Sir, you should focus all your attention
on locating this man.

24:47.819 --> 24:50.864
In the meantime,
we'll find as many guns as possible

24:50.947 --> 24:51.948
and get a lead

24:53.533 --> 24:54.659
on this bastard.

24:59.956 --> 25:01.458
Announcement from HQ.

25:01.541 --> 25:04.544
We have a lead on suspects
impersonating police to obtain firearms,

25:04.628 --> 25:06.630
so all officers are now
on emergency alert.

25:06.713 --> 25:09.841
Collect all firearms
at the listed addresses without delay.

25:09.925 --> 25:11.092
I repeat.

25:11.676 --> 25:14.262
We have a lead
on suspects impersonating police…

25:15.013 --> 25:16.014
MY DAUGHTER

25:20.310 --> 25:22.729
The person you are calling
is currently unavailable.

25:22.812 --> 25:24.981
Please try again later.

25:25.774 --> 25:29.402
REAL ESTATE
BUY AND SELL, RENT, BROKERAGE

25:37.494 --> 25:38.662
Dad, can you

25:39.246 --> 25:40.455
help me out?

25:41.206 --> 25:42.999
Huh? Why?

25:43.667 --> 25:46.545
Can you get an advance on your pension?

25:48.088 --> 25:50.382
Have you lost it, you little brat?

25:50.465 --> 25:53.260
- Trying to butter me up?
- Can't you just help me?

25:54.094 --> 25:57.305
- Sir.
- Then file a report with the police!

25:57.389 --> 25:59.015
- Sir.
- What do you want?

25:59.099 --> 26:00.559
Please help me.

26:00.642 --> 26:03.687
Without that money, I'm dead.
Please have mercy.

26:03.770 --> 26:05.897
I'm begging you. Please.

26:05.981 --> 26:06.815
Let go, damn it.

26:06.898 --> 26:09.067
Dad spent his life working for it.

26:09.150 --> 26:10.735
- It's his pension.
- Just sue me.

26:10.819 --> 26:12.279
God, seriously.

26:13.029 --> 26:16.199
Please have mercy. Sir.

26:58.408 --> 27:00.118
It's Gong! He's here!

27:00.744 --> 27:01.828
Shit, why is he here?

27:01.911 --> 27:03.371
- Get rid of them!
- Hide them!

27:03.455 --> 27:04.289
Fucking hell!

27:04.372 --> 27:06.249
Hey, hurry!

27:06.333 --> 27:07.334
We're fucked.

27:07.417 --> 27:09.711
Come on, quickly!

27:10.920 --> 27:11.755
Hurry!

27:21.431 --> 27:22.432
Give it here.

27:28.480 --> 27:30.482
My dear Jeong-man.

27:31.608 --> 27:32.442
Hello, sir.

27:34.402 --> 27:35.445
What's with this vibe?

27:38.990 --> 27:42.452
What were you all doing
to be this out of breath?

27:42.535 --> 27:43.453
Sorry?

27:44.579 --> 27:46.539
Oh, right. We were just cleaning.

27:49.626 --> 27:52.587
What do you expect
from a rundown building like this?

27:52.671 --> 27:53.672
Don't sweat it.

27:56.925 --> 27:58.301
First time seeing me, boys?

27:59.511 --> 28:00.553
Hello, sir.

28:00.637 --> 28:02.055
Yeah, likewise.

28:02.555 --> 28:03.556
Have a seat, sir.

28:07.102 --> 28:08.812
I saw a famous bakery on the way.

28:10.021 --> 28:10.855
I see.

28:15.944 --> 28:16.778
Right.

28:17.862 --> 28:18.697
Thank you.

28:18.780 --> 28:21.533
You once asked
if I knew your boys' names, didn't you?

28:22.242 --> 28:23.076
Sorry?

28:23.159 --> 28:26.496
I've felt awful about that ever since.

28:27.205 --> 28:30.291
I figured there'd be about 20.
That should be enough, right?

28:31.376 --> 28:33.503
Yes, this is enough.

28:34.087 --> 28:35.922
Hey, take these and share them.

28:37.298 --> 28:38.258
Jeong-man.

28:40.385 --> 28:41.845
Why don't we talk?

28:45.181 --> 28:46.474
Give us a minute, guys.

28:48.101 --> 28:49.519
Thank you for the bread.

28:49.602 --> 28:50.979
Sure. You're welcome!

29:12.041 --> 29:13.042
Jeong-man.

29:13.960 --> 29:14.794
Yes, sir.

29:15.754 --> 29:17.839
I've been missing Mr. Kim lately.

29:19.507 --> 29:20.884
I wonder how he is.

29:21.551 --> 29:23.928
He should still be buried deep, right?

29:26.473 --> 29:30.393
Why are you suddenly asking about him?
You know better than anyone.

29:32.020 --> 29:33.021
That's right.

29:35.440 --> 29:36.441
I do.

29:50.079 --> 29:51.456
Ta-da!

29:52.540 --> 29:54.125
This is Mr. Kim's phone.

29:54.918 --> 29:59.172
Those idiots brought me his phone
without asking for the passcode.

29:59.255 --> 30:03.927
This phone has all the clients' contacts,
but I can't get my hands on the cash.

30:04.010 --> 30:05.136
But, you know,

30:06.554 --> 30:08.097
I don't know it either.

30:08.181 --> 30:09.265
I know.

30:10.850 --> 30:14.145
But you, Jeong-man, can unlock this phone.

30:15.522 --> 30:16.356
Me?

30:24.280 --> 30:26.574
Cut off Mr. Kim's fingers
and bring them to me. All ten.

30:28.284 --> 30:30.954
You know where his body is.

30:33.748 --> 30:35.458
The sooner, the better.

30:37.418 --> 30:40.547
Before all his fingers rot away.

30:44.884 --> 30:47.387
Hey, I came to test the waters with him.

30:47.470 --> 30:50.431
It seems certain
that Gu Jeong-man is hiding Mr. Kim.

30:50.515 --> 30:53.101
I told him to come to the club tomorrow,
so get ready.

30:53.685 --> 30:57.063
Make sure to leave me out of this mess,
"Police in Name Only."

30:59.732 --> 31:01.109
Man, this bastard…

31:09.909 --> 31:10.994
Hey, Jeong-man.

31:11.494 --> 31:14.581
What did that bastard Gong say?

31:18.418 --> 31:20.044
Why the stare? Just spit it out.

31:26.926 --> 31:28.428
Do you trust me, Mr. Kim?

31:29.012 --> 31:31.055
Why ask that now? You're scaring me.

31:31.139 --> 31:33.349
I trust you. What'd that bastard say?

31:34.726 --> 31:36.811
He wants me to take him your fingers.

31:37.687 --> 31:38.521
All ten.

32:12.138 --> 32:12.972
Let's go.

32:14.682 --> 32:15.975
Let's go.

32:40.291 --> 32:41.125
Yes, sir.

32:42.001 --> 32:44.879
Gu Jeong-man came to retrieve
Mr. Kim's fingers.

32:48.257 --> 32:51.511
Okay, got it.
Make sure to keep a close eye on him.

32:52.178 --> 32:53.179
Yes, understood.

32:55.682 --> 32:59.394
If you're buried here,
no one will ever find your body.

33:02.105 --> 33:04.148
They're looking for Mr. Kim's fingers.

33:20.581 --> 33:22.417
What are those bastards doing?

33:23.793 --> 33:24.836
I have no idea.

33:25.503 --> 33:29.382
But, sir, why are you so worried
about Gu Jeong-man?

33:32.176 --> 33:35.805
If he bothers you that much,
I can take care of him quietly.

33:37.390 --> 33:38.224
You?

33:41.811 --> 33:44.355
You don't know
what Gu Jeong-man's strength is, do you?

33:44.439 --> 33:46.524
That bastard has strengths?

33:46.607 --> 33:51.154
Gu Jeong-man
really fucking cares about his boys.

33:56.451 --> 33:57.452
Give it back.

33:58.077 --> 34:00.580
Forget it. Just stick to your cigarettes.

34:01.080 --> 34:02.331
- Show me the photo.
- Sure.

34:07.670 --> 34:10.048
Of course.

34:10.548 --> 34:13.718
No one can clean up
quite like you, Jeong-man.

34:15.053 --> 34:16.596
Do you have a cast iron stomach?

34:16.679 --> 34:18.848
Here, this is for your trouble.

34:18.931 --> 34:21.768
Thank you. I have to do
whatever brings in money.

34:21.851 --> 34:23.686
I have all those boys to look after.

34:23.770 --> 34:26.522
That's why his group keeps growing,
not shrinking,

34:26.606 --> 34:28.816
even after doing this crap
for over a decade.

34:29.317 --> 34:32.320
Still, they're just scrawny busters,
aren't they?

34:35.364 --> 34:37.116
That's the problem.

34:38.367 --> 34:40.912
You know anything
about those scrawny punks?

34:42.205 --> 34:44.248
People are on the streets
with guns right now.

34:45.083 --> 34:48.628
Could you fend off someone
you don't recognize or know by name

34:49.629 --> 34:51.214
if he came at you with a gun?

34:53.091 --> 34:54.092
That's why

34:55.384 --> 34:58.471
the best option is to use the cop
to take out Gu Jeong-man.

35:00.139 --> 35:02.517
But if he tells the police
what he did for you--

35:02.600 --> 35:03.726
When did I say

35:04.602 --> 35:06.479
I was going to hand him over alive?

35:09.482 --> 35:10.483
Just watch

35:12.151 --> 35:13.444
my plan unfold.

35:21.577 --> 35:23.287
- Did you load everything?
- Yeah.

35:25.248 --> 35:26.124
Let's go!

35:34.382 --> 35:38.719
Yes. Gu Jeong-man has been busy digging
since morning, and now he's moving again.

36:02.368 --> 36:03.202
Yes, sir.

36:06.038 --> 36:07.957
Those bastards just entered the bathhouse.

36:08.541 --> 36:09.667
The bathhouse?

36:11.711 --> 36:15.173
That's their routine,
taking a bath after they dig.

36:15.756 --> 36:16.632
Watch them closely.

36:16.716 --> 36:19.218
When Gu Jeong-man leaves,
go to his office.

36:19.760 --> 36:21.470
I'll go once I wrap up here.

36:25.266 --> 36:26.893
Why, you motherfuckers.

36:26.976 --> 36:30.021
Hey, get the hell out of here!

36:38.112 --> 36:41.032
You bunch of fucking morons.

36:41.782 --> 36:44.994
Hey, Mr. Gong is waiting
for Mr. Kim's fingers.

36:45.077 --> 36:46.287
Go see him now.

36:48.122 --> 36:49.123
Jeong-man.

36:50.124 --> 36:52.501
Turn on the hot water before you leave.

37:00.676 --> 37:04.222
Hey, move your head, damn it.
Let me take a look at his tool.

37:05.556 --> 37:09.769
Man, his tool is tiny as shit.
What a fucking loser.

37:23.282 --> 37:24.533
YAKAM TOURIST HOTEL

37:24.617 --> 37:27.286
Damn it.
What's taking those bastards so long?

37:28.454 --> 37:31.249
I gotta say, this doesn't look like
an ordinary public bathhouse.

37:31.332 --> 37:35.002
Man, are these bastards trying
to mess with us?

37:36.295 --> 37:37.880
Detective, that's Gu Jeong-man.

37:45.221 --> 37:46.055
Detective Seo.

37:46.555 --> 37:48.766
Gu Jeong-man is heading to the club now.

38:01.195 --> 38:03.864
GU JEONG-MAN
I'M ON MY WAY WITH MR. KIM'S FINGERS

38:08.119 --> 38:08.953
He's here.

38:09.662 --> 38:11.789
Everyone, check your guns
and bulletproof vests.

38:11.872 --> 38:14.750
There could be a shooting,
so be on high alert.

38:21.424 --> 38:23.134
Stay alert.

38:40.276 --> 38:42.153
Hey, come in.

38:53.539 --> 38:54.582
What's with you?

38:57.084 --> 38:57.918
Good to see you.

38:59.378 --> 39:00.838
Gong, you fucking bitch.

39:02.006 --> 39:04.050
You asked for my fingers, didn't you?

39:08.763 --> 39:09.597
So,

39:11.140 --> 39:12.808
are you gonna cut my fingers off?

39:13.517 --> 39:14.352
No.

39:16.437 --> 39:17.813
I don't use knives anymore.

39:18.773 --> 39:19.607
Then what?

39:20.608 --> 39:22.735
Take him all of your fingers yourself.

39:24.153 --> 39:25.738
I'll give you a gun.

39:33.746 --> 39:35.664
Gu Jeong-man, that motherfucker…

39:40.711 --> 39:42.088
What the fuck was that?

39:43.798 --> 39:44.799
Hey.

39:48.219 --> 39:49.637
How do you like my tool?

39:50.763 --> 39:51.764
Dope, isn't it?

43:53.464 --> 43:58.469
Subtitle translation by: Sung In Jang
